{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLACKSHARD</strong> is a first-person exploration game. Wander  <br>through a strange megastructure, the Labyrinth, to unravel its <br>mysteries. Your behavior within the Labyrinth defines the  <br>outcome of your journey.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLACKSHARD</strong> is a visual and narrative experience, a dreamlike journey <br>into uncharted liminal spaces. You will roam strange places,  <br>endless corridors and unreal architectures, encountering mysterious <br>figures that have been forgotten for ages...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What path will you take?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223390/extras/333c1142b2d18e5efbb000eef0e9c22e.avif?t=1750428176\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a unique semi-open world. Find your own way through the <br>Labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find shards of memory from those who came before. Accept the order of <br>things or choose a different path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with your environment. Transform the Labyrinth with <br>unspeakable powers, or preserve its cold complexity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beware. You were not made for such a journey.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223390/extras/11954edd719fbc1df7195e46b732b839.avif?t=1750428176\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;I waited for a time that cannot be told.  <br>  <br>The Labyrinth is a dull, sterile and ordered space. It is the embodiment  <br>of time and causality. The harbinger of the Tyranny of Fate.  <br>  <br>I played my part. I watched over the Labyrinth. I resisted the whispers.  <br>I did not intervene. I did not count the unclean numbers.  <br>  <br>But the Sign promises. It offers.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223390/extras/e20688b101edb6271b17167424af5196.avif?t=1750428176\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Watcher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3223390/2cd02ea43b763cda03e2ae472c5fd433d087a58c.jpg"},{"name":"Carcosa","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3223390/3a02f0b9e01a48ee4d2b910384bd9717b2425b07.jpg"},{"name":"Shattering","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3223390/bf58e571def3aa18736e6e17fd5f40f2ad735a47.jpg"},{"name":"Eternal Return","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3223390/7079d2f4363bb51906b36b484285afa6aa189420.jpg"},{"name":"Non-Euclydian Mapping","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3223390/16aa861eea5a5818884705f4090ad4592d103e8f.jpg"},{"name":"Frenzied Librarian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3223390/6ae49905de0a50d6a43b7d9dcc79efe872b0d681.jpg"},{"name":"Mind your step!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3223390/3fad6ff59afce209f645d1667df2b28605ff709d.jpg"},{"name":"A Heavy Cost","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3223390/b6601b186dc74d5e78f5bf6ff33bba3a2bed7140.jpg"},{"name":"Quantum Observer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3223390/b83e197ea81289155b49dc97168276a54af19759.jpg"},{"n